 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2019-08-02",
   "text": "Combatting Unreasonable Rises and Excessively High Drug Prices Act or the CURE High Drug Prices Act\n This bill prohibits price gouging by manufacturers of prescription drugs (including a combination of a drug, device, or biological product) that are covered by a federal health care program. The bill specifies percentage increases in price at which price gouging is presumed."
  }
 ],
